    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d79-a12">

                <pb facs="0178" n="82" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg82"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 12.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fowler to Mr. Conger</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chefoo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-12-04"><hi rendition="#italic">December 4,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Hamilton wires looting continues, violence increasing, burning converts’ houses.
                    Forty-five families looted to date. Governor refuses to hear his subordinates or
                    Americans.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fowler.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
